Here’s a concise, client-shareable cheat sheet.

^^^^Main wrapper:^^^^ "/defrag/tools/ptosc_restartable_defrag_PREPROD_FINAL.sh" — restartable pt-online-schema-change automation with validation, resume logic, trigger handling, MDL watchdog, and retained "_old" table support.

^^^^Monitor:^^^^ "/defrag/tools/ptosc_monitor.sh" — real-time monitor for copy progress, load, objects, triggers, MDL, file sizes, logs, and restart state.

^^^^Discovery script:^^^^ "/defrag/tools/fragmentation_discovery.sh" — read-only candidate discovery and fragmentation assessment.

^^^^Percona binary:^^^^ "/defrag/tools/percona-toolkit-3.x/bin/pt-online-schema-change" — underlying pt-online-schema-change executable.

^^^^Connection/config file:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/ptosc.cnf" — MySQL connection configuration used by the wrapper.

^^^^Runtime base directory:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/" — per-run runtime/state/log directory.

^^^^Wrapper console log:^^^^ "/defrag/tools/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>.restartable.nohup.out" — high-level wrapper execution and state-transition log.

^^^^pt-osc detailed log:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/pt-online-schema-change.log" — detailed Percona copy/cutover log.

^^^^Final validation:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/final-validation.txt" — post-cutover size, filesystem, statistics, and validation evidence.

^^^^MDL blocker log:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/killed-blockers.log" — records sessions killed by the metadata-lock watchdog.

^^^^PID file:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/ptosc.pid" — running pt-osc process ID.

^^^^Pause file:^^^^ "/root/ptosc/<SCHEMA>.<TABLE>/<TIMESTAMP>/pause.flag" — pause control used by pt-osc.

^^^^History table:^^^^ "percona.pt_osc_history" — stores restart/resume boundaries and job completion state.

^^^^Active table file:^^^^ "/var/lib/mysql/<SCHEMA>/<TABLE>.ibd" — live InnoDB table.

^^^^Temporary copy:^^^^ "/var/lib/mysql/<SCHEMA>/_<TABLE>_new.ibd" — shadow table during copy.

^^^^Retained original:^^^^ "/var/lib/mysql/<SCHEMA>/_<TABLE>_old.ibd" — original table retained after successful cutover.

^^^^Binary logs:^^^^ "/var/lib/mysql-binlog/" — MySQL binary-log filesystem.

^^^^Relay logs:^^^^ "/var/lib/mysql-relaylog/" — replica relay-log filesystem.

