### Post-validation cleanup

After application validation and replica lag reaches zero, drop the retained original on the ^^^^source/master only^^^^:

"""sql
DROP TABLE <SCHEMA>._<TABLE>_old;
"""

Then allow that DROP to replicate naturally to the replica.
